(b) the version of the complainant prima- facie on preliminary investigation is not supported by any material;
(c) present applicant does not have any past antecedent.
7.

The applicant is ordered to be released on bail in the event of his arrest in connection with a FIR being C.R. No.11205043220638 of 2022 dated 17.6.2022 registered with Bhuj 'B' Division Police Station, District : West Kutch on his executing a personal bond of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten Thousand Only) with one surety of like amount each on the following conditions:
(a) shall cooperate with the investigation and make himself available for interrogation whenever required;
(b) shall remain present at concerned Police Station on 21.4.2023 between 11.00 a.m. and 2.00 p.m.;
(c) shall not directly or indirectly make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the fact of the case so as to dissuade him from disclosing such facts to the court or to any police officer;
